Package: catdir
Version: 2.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: awesomeshot5051 englandtechnologies@gmail.com
Depends: python3
Recommends: fd-find | ripgrep
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: A robust directory-to-context text aggregator.
 catdir crawls a directory, filters out binary files, respects depths/sizes,
 and outputs a cleanly structured layout or JSON stream. Ideal for gathering
 codebase context for analysis or documentation.
